{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423446001:1":{"text":"혹시 평민을 도와주러 온 제사장인가요? 사리에가 무슨 도움이 필요한지 알아보라고 해서 왔어요!","source_cn":"你就是那位想要救助平民的祭司吗？沙利叶让我们来问问你有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1153723E1DC04801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423446002:1":{"text":"마침 잘 오셨어요! 제 지갑이 사라졌거든요... 그건 평민 지역 아이들이 먹을 음식을 사려고 모은 돈이에요!","source_cn":"你们来得正好！我的钱袋不见了……那是我给平民区孩子们买...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F4E25810227A26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423446003:1":{"text":"지갑 좀 찾아 주시겠어요? 가방이 지저분하긴 한데, 신경쓰지 마세요...","source_cn":"能帮我找找我的钱袋吗？包里有点乱，请不要介意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB948841748DC943F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}